%% Disaster Recovery Diagram
graph TB
    subgraph Primary["af-south-1 (Primary)"]
        P_API[API Gateway]
        P_DDB[(DynamoDB Global Tables)]
        P_S3[(S3 Event Archive)]
        P_HC[Route 53 Health Check]
    end

    subgraph DR["eu-west-1 (DR)"]
        D_DDB[(DynamoDB Global Tables replica)]
        D_S3[(S3 Event Archive — CRR replica)]
    end

    P_DDB <-->|Global Tables replication, seconds| D_DDB
    P_S3 -->|Cross-Region Replication| D_S3
    P_HC -->|failure detected| FAILOVER[runbooks/dr-failover.md:\nmanual compute-layer deploy to eu-west-1]
    FAILOVER --> DR

    Note["RTO: 15 min / RPO: 5 min\nCompute layer (Lambda/API GW/EventBridge/SQS/SNS)\nis NOT pre-warmed in DR — see cost-analysis.md"]
